{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50520","headline":"句 · 王坚","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"良宰多忧悯，虔诚谒庶神。\n（〖1〗句次赵不爲祈雨诗句後，曰「七𠥱〖月〗廿三〖乙〗〖日〗，文林郎王坚诗曰〖句不重录〗」云云\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50520.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50520","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}